WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.847
Your first groove. 140 BPM / C MINOR / FOUR BARS
LISTEN → BUILD → SHAPE → JAM

2
00:00:06.857 --> 00:00:13.704
Start with four bars. New project. Tempo 140. Grid 1/16. Swing 50%.
HOLD TAP TEMPO + TURN ENCODER

3
00:00:13.714 --> 00:00:20.561
Load the kit. Rhythmer Kit → DRUM-X / 909 CLUB
ENCODER ↻ SELECT / PUSH → LOAD

4
00:00:20.571 --> 00:00:27.419
Record the broken beat. Kick: Pad 1. Snare: Pad 2. Soft hats: Pad 4.
SAMPLE → SEQ RECORD → PLAY ▶

5
00:00:27.429 --> 00:00:34.276
Find the bass. FMini-1 / SUB BASS
PAD BANK + 3 → PLUG-IN → PRESETS

6
00:00:34.286 --> 00:00:41.133
Keep it short + low. C2 → Ab1 → Bb1 → G1. One root per bar.
C MINOR / SCALE / OCT 1 → RECORD

7
00:00:41.143 --> 00:00:47.990
Change the track type. T4: TRACK TYPE → PLUG-IN. Patterns stay.
PAD FX + KNOB FX → B1 TRACK SETUP

8
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:54.847
Choose the pad sound. FM-106 / original A68 Synth Pad
SELECT FM-106 → PRESETS → LOAD

9
00:00:54.857 --> 00:01:01.704
Open it a little. VCF Cutoff 64. Resonance 8. Voice: POLY I.
TURN THE LABELLED SOUND CONTROLS ↻

10
00:01:01.714 --> 00:01:08.561
Play four chords. Cm7 → Abmaj7 → Bbadd9 → Gm7
C MINOR / SCALE / OCT 3 → RECORD

11
00:01:08.571 --> 00:01:15.419
Soften the top end. TRACK FX → Tone → Filter. Low pass.
SHIFT + KNOB FX → EMPTY SLOT → PUSH

12
00:01:15.429 --> 00:01:22.276
Give the chords space. TRACK FX → Space → Plate
K1–K3 ↻ EDIT / − + CHANGE ROW

13
00:01:22.286 --> 00:01:29.133
Add an acid voice. T5: Acid Engine / SQUELCH. Four bars.
PAD BANK + 5 → LOAD → SEQ

14
00:01:29.143 --> 00:01:35.990
Generate. Then edit. DENSITY 70% / ACCENT 40% / SLIDE 25%
PATTERNS → SHIFT + B3 → APPLY

15
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:42.847
Make it answer the bass. Edit the generated notes to fit the harmony.
ROLL → NOTES / LENGTH / ACCENTS

16
00:01:42.857 --> 00:01:49.704
Bring in the Think break. think-160-preview.wav / source: 2 bars at 160 BPM
PAD BANK + 6 → BREAK ENGINE → LOAD

17
00:01:49.714 --> 00:01:56.561
Chop it into four bars. Generate a starting pattern. Keep and edit the slices.
BREAK GEN → APPLY → ROLL

18
00:01:56.571 --> 00:02:03.419
Catch the last beat. BRK PERF → ROLLS: Pad 7 / 1/8 UP
SEQ RECORD → HOLD PAD 7 → RELEASE

19
00:02:03.429 --> 00:02:10.276
Balance the five parts. LEVEL: T2 80 / T3 78 / T4 82 / T5 62 / T6 68
TRACKS → K1 TRACK / K2 LEVEL / K3 PAN

20
00:02:10.286 --> 00:02:17.133
Turn the loop into a jam. Stay on TRACKS. Tap MUTE, then numbered pads.
MUTE → PADS 2–6 TOGGLE TRACKS

21
00:02:17.143 --> 00:02:23.990
Mute. Bring it back. Break + bass + chords
MUTE + TRACK PADS / PLAY ON THE DOWNBEAT

22
00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:30.847
Mute. Bring it back. Remove bass; add acid
MUTE + TRACK PADS / PLAY ON THE DOWNBEAT

23
00:02:30.857 --> 00:02:37.704
Mute. Bring it back. Drums + bass + acid
MUTE + TRACK PADS / PLAY ON THE DOWNBEAT

24
00:02:37.714 --> 00:02:44.561
Mute. Bring it back. Full groove returns
MUTE + TRACK PADS / PLAY ON THE DOWNBEAT

25
00:02:44.571 --> 00:02:51.419
Keep the groove. Save the project. Keep the Think WAV on the card.
SHIFT + PAD 16 → SAVE
